p derived dependency and SCC alias rebinding. Entry production execution also still needs selected-profile derivation. The include test is red until these are integrated; the fixture harness currently uses a trusted uninstrumented source. Statement selection, adjacent suppression, hoisted semicolon threshold, nested-zero and registry mutation fixtures and fixes were not completed. The full fixture set, additivity checks and cljstyle gate were not run. Do not interpret these commits as production ticks or parity acceptance.\\nEOF'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\ncollab/yang-php/1794569052000-engineer-p7b-ticks-g.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log:101:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_49\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"cat > collab/yang-php/1794569546000-engineer-p7b-ticks-g.gpt-6.1-terra.findings.md <<'EOF'\\nCreated-GMT: 2026-11-13 11:32:26 GMT\\nCreated-Local: 2026-11-13 18:32:26 +0700\\nCoding-Agent: codex\\nRole: Engineer\\nStatus: partial; include gate red; P7-b part G incomplete\\n\\nPushed c347f086 and b784516b to p7b-ticks. PHP unit publication now writes a content-addressed occurrence site set and a record binding it to the manifest, canonical tree root, frontend revision and lowering profile. The set preserves the mark's explicit unit operand; empty sets are published. The verifier rejects missing or mismatched metadata and checks the set's canonical ordering. PHP SCC aliases publish their own empty sets; the bundle retains its marks. The shared publication seam defaults to the previous alias behavior for other frontends.\\n\\nSequential checks: siteset-test initially 1 test / 4 assertions green; include-handoff-test completed under the 600-second limit with 3 failures, no errors: semantic, stack and register each produced \\\"'`L` instead of `LT`. It did not time out; no claim of a dao.jing-class stall. The expanded siteset-test passed 3 tests / 11 assertions. clj-kondo over the four changed code/test files reported 0 errors and 0 warnings. The commit hook formatted the staged files. No Docker or oracle run; existing fixture statuses remain pending.\\n\\nRemaining work: site publication and verification alone do not implement signed discovery, verified link-time derivation, hook dependency publication/pinning, or bottom-up derived dependency and SCC alias rebinding. Entry production execution also still needs selected-profile derivation. The include test is red until these are integrated; the fixture harness currently uses a trusted uninstrumented source. Statement selection, adjacent suppression, hoisted semicolon threshold, nested-zero and registry mutation fixtures and fixes were not completed. The full fixture set, additivity checks and cljstyle gate were not run. Do not interpret these commits as production ticks or parity acceptance.\\nEOF'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ncollab/yang-php/1794566777000-engineer-p7b-ticks-b.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log:32:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_16\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"cat > test/yang/php/antlr/programs_p7b.cljc <<'EOF'\\n(ns yang.php.antlr.programs-p7b\\n  \\\\\\\"Hand-derived tick expectations pending the pinned PHP oracle pass.\\\\\\\")\\n\\n\\n(def prologue\\n  \\\\\\\"function tick_handler() { echo 'T'; } register_tick_function('tick_handler'); \\\\\\\")\\n\\n\\n(def fixtures\\n  [{:id :sequence, :source \\\\\\\"declare(ticks=1) { echo 'A'; \\\"'$x = 1; echo '\\\"'B'; }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"ATTBT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :loop-body, :source \\\\\\\"for (\\\"'$i=0; $i<2; $i++) { declare(ticks=1) { echo '\\\"'A'; } }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"ATAT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :function-call, :source \\\\\\\"function f() { echo 'F'; } declare(ticks=1) { f(); }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"FT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :generator-resume,\\n    :source \\\\\\\"function g() { declare(ticks=1) { yield 1; echo 'B'; } } \\\"'$g=g(); $g->current(); echo '\\\"'A'; \\\"'$g->next();\\\",\\n    :out \\\"ATBT\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :include-handoff, :source \\\"include '\\\"'lib.php';\\\\\\\",\\n    :units {\\\\\\\"lib.php\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"<?php declare(ticks=1) { echo 'L'; }\\\\\\\"},\\n    :out \\\\\\\"LT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}])\\nEOF\\ntimeout 120 clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.ticks-test\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\ncollab/yang-php/1794566777000-engineer-p7b-ticks-b.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log:33:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_16\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"cat > test/yang/php/antlr/programs_p7b.cljc <<'EOF'\\n(ns yang.php.antlr.programs-p7b\\n  \\\\\\\"Hand-derived tick expectations pending the pinned PHP oracle pass.\\\\\\\")\\n\\n\\n(def prologue\\n  \\\\\\\"function tick_handler() { echo 'T'; } register_tick_function('tick_handler'); \\\\\\\")\\n\\n\\n(def fixtures\\n  [{:id :sequence, :source \\\\\\\"declare(ticks=1) { echo 'A'; \\\"'$x = 1; echo '\\\"'B'; }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"ATTBT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :loop-body, :source \\\\\\\"for (\\\"'$i=0; $i<2; $i++) { declare(ticks=1) { echo '\\\"'A'; } }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"ATAT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :function-call, :source \\\\\\\"function f() { echo 'F'; } declare(ticks=1) { f(); }\\\\\\\",\\n    :out \\\\\\\"FT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :generator-resume,\\n    :source \\\\\\\"function g() { declare(ticks=1) { yield 1; echo 'B'; } } \\\"'$g=g(); $g->current(); echo '\\\"'A'; \\\"'$g->next();\\\",\\n    :out \\\"ATBT\\\", :oracle :pending}\\n   {:id :include-handoff, :source \\\"include '\\\"'lib.php';\\\\\\\",\\n    :units {\\\\\\\"lib.php\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"<?php declare(ticks=1) { echo 'L'; }\\\\\\\"},\\n    :out \\\\\\\"LT\\\\\\\", :oracle :pending}])\\nEOF\\ntimeout 120 clojure -M:test -n yang.php.antlr.ticks-test\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"Loading initial Timbre config from: :default\\n\\nRunning tests in #{\\\"test\\\"}\\nWARNING: load already refers to: #'clojure.core/load in namespace: yin.vm.encoder, being replaced by: #'yin.vm.encoder/load\\n\\nTesting yang.php.antlr.ticks-test\\n\\nFAIL in (tick-fixtures-test) (ticks_test.clj:11)\\nsequence\\nexpected: (= out (:php/out (h/run-raw (str \\\"<?php \\\" p7b/prologue source))))\\n  actual: (not (= \\\"ATTBT\\\" \\\"\\\"))\\n\\nFAIL in (tick-fixtures-test) (ticks_test.clj:11)\\nloop-body\\nexpected: (= out (:php/out (h/run-raw (str \\\"<?php \\\" p7b/prologue source))))\\n  actual: (not (= \\\"ATAT\\\" \\\"\\\"))\\n\\nFAIL in (tick-fixtures-test) (ticks_test.clj:11)\\nfunction-call\\nexpected: (= out (:php/out (h/run-raw (str \\\"<?php \\\" p7b/prologue source))))\\n  actual: (not (= \\\"FT\\\" \\\"\\\"))\\n\\nFAIL in (tick-fixtures-test) (ticks_test.clj:11)\\ngenerator-resume\\nexpected: (= out (:php/out (h/run-raw (str \\\"<?php \\\" p7b/prologue source))))\\n  actual: (not (= \\\"ATBT\\\" \\\"\\\"))\\n\\nFAIL in (tick-fixtures-test) (ticks_test.clj:11)\\ninclude-handoff\\nexpected: (= out (:php/out (h/run-raw (str \\\"<?php \\\" p7b/prologue source))))\\n  actual: (not (= \\\"LT\\\" nil))\\n\\nRan 1 tests containing 5 assertions.\\n5 failures, 0 errors.\\n\",\"exit_code\":1,\"status\":\"failed\"}}\ncollab/yang-php/1794566777000-engineer-p7b-ticks-b.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log:44:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_22\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"python3 - <<'PY'\\np='test/yang/php/antlr/ticks_test.clj'\\ns=open(p).read().replace('[yang.php.antlr.e2e-harness :as h]', '[yang.php.antlr.cst :as cst]\\\\\\\\n    [yang.php.antlr.e2e-harness :as h]\\\\\\\\n    [yang.php.antlr.linked-harness :as lh]')\\ns=s.replace('(doseq [{:keys [id source out]} p7b/fixtures]', '(doseq [{:keys [id source out units]} p7b/fixtures\\\\\\\\n          :when (nil? units)]'