{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing verifier validates and transforms the published tree, but the linker currently serves the original module and the linked harness uses trusted derivation. I’m implementing the missing link-time stage around those existing primitives, including dependency rebinding and a separately published hook module."}}
